{"name": "Dark Queen of Samobor", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/6fd555addcd791de607fa98373b8676f.poster.avif?t=1787244339\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/6fd555addcd791de607fa98373b8676f.webm?t=1787244339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/6fd555addcd791de607fa98373b8676f.mp4?t=1787244339\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dark Queen of Samobor is an atmospheric 2.5D side-scroller action-adventure set in a beautiful and haunting world of old Slavic and Croatian tales and legends.\u00a0</strong>Featuring handcrafted visuals inspired by the classic Disney animation and dark fantasy movies of the 80s.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"436\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/6dc5a04e5dee31f5487753c5c445cc67.poster.avif?t=1787244339\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/6dc5a04e5dee31f5487753c5c445cc67.webm?t=1787244339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/6dc5a04e5dee31f5487753c5c445cc67.mp4?t=1787244339\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Cinematic Moments</strong></h2><h2 c